WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:06.450
Welcome to The David Pakman Show, I am Jesse
Moore, sitting in for David while he is luxuriating

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:16.740
on vacation today in America, especially related
to covid, there are two camps of people.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:23.279
You have the camp that is concerned for their
fellow citizens and want to stop the onslaught

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:30.659
of the virus that has resulted in the deaths
of over 600000 Americans and millions worldwide.

00:00:30.659 --> 00:00:38.460
And the other camp is comprised of people
who are colluding against the first camp.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:42.970
Fortunately not, unfortunately, fortunately,
we seem if you're watching this and you're

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:46.830
of like mind, we're on the first team.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:53.080
And fortunately, now we have a government
that is standing in the gap for those most

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:59.720
in need relative to protection, I hold in
my hand here a memorandum for all Department

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:06.939
of Defense employees written by Lloyd Austin,
former general and now secretary of defense.

00:01:06.939 --> 00:01:07.939
And he is

00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:15.549
mandating with the president's approval seeking
President Biden's approval to have all military

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:19.909
personnel and Department of Defense employees
vaccinated by mid-September.

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:24.450
I'm going to read a little bit from this memorandum
because I believe it's important to give context

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.679
of the words of the leaders.

00:01:27.679 --> 00:01:31.979
Over the last week, I have consulted closely
with the chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff,

00:01:31.979 --> 00:01:36.909
the secretaries of the military departments,
the service chiefs and medical professionals.

00:01:36.909 --> 00:01:41.939
I appreciate greatly the advice and counsel
they provided based on these consultations

00:01:41.939 --> 00:01:45.869
and on additional discussions with leaders
of the White House covid Task Force.

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:50.750
I want you to know that I will seek the president's
approval to make the vaccines mandatory no

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:55.859
later than mid-September or immediately upon
the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.

00:01:55.859 --> 00:01:59.149
Leisinger, whichever comes first.

00:01:59.149 --> 00:02:04.859
By way of expectation, public reporting suggests
that the Pfizer vaccine could achieve full

00:02:04.859 --> 00:02:05.859
FDA

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:09.750
licensure early next month to defend this
nation.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.159
We need a healthy and ready force.

00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:17.540
I strongly encourage all DOD military and
civilian personnel, as well as contractor

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:24.900
personnel to get vaccinated now and for military
service members to not wait for the mandate.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:29.780
All FDA authorized covid-19 vaccines are safe,
highly effective.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.220
They will protect you and your family.

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:37.319
They will protect your unit, your ship and
your coworkers, and they will ensure we remain

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:41.160
the most lethal and ready force in the world.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:47.959
Now, many of you probably have no idea who
I am, but for the edification of those who

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:53.720
don't know, I served in the United States
Marine Corps for many years and there is sure

00:02:53.720 --> 00:03:00.769
to be some backlash among some of the more
right wing nutters in the military.

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:03.719
And rest assured, there are many of them.

00:03:03.719 --> 00:03:06.200
When I was in the Marine Corps,

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:12.030
they did this DNA testing where they took
a drop of blood and there was an outcry from

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:16.480
many acting as though there was a conspiracy
afoot.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.940
And the same thing is going to happen here.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:26.879
Now, what I find interesting is the fact that
the the same the same people in the camp who

00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:33.180
talk about the military being too sensitive
and being too woak are the same that are going

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:39.940
to act like this is an imposing some kind
of a problem on the military members who are

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.450
largely.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:47.579
Dutiful people who care about their oath to
support and defend the Constitution, who care

00:03:47.579 --> 00:03:51.109
about their country, who care about their
neighbors.

00:03:51.109 --> 00:03:55.900
That's not the case with everybody.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:01.230
But it matters that our military get vaccinated
not just for the communities in which they

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:08.370
live, but so we have a viable ready force
in case something does happen

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.920
where they need to be deployed.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:17.900
Now, President Biden released a statement
and in part he said, I strongly support Secretary

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.220
Austins message to the force today on the
Department of Defense's plan to add the covid-19

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:26.470
vaccine to the list of required vaccinations
for our service members.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.130
Not later than mid-September.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:33.680
Secretary Austin and I share an unshakable
commitment to making sure our troops have

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:38.520
every tool they need to do their jobs as safely
as possible.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:42.460
These vaccines will save lives.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.169
That's what this is about.

00:04:45.169 --> 00:04:47.210
Saving lives.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:52.100
This is about protecting lives.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:05:01.670
And in a not so abstract way, isn't that indeed
what the military is there for, to protect?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.240
Lives.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:07.620
To care for the citizenry of this country.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:33.849
To not be vaccinated goes against 

00:05:33.849 --> 00:06:16.099
that ethos.

